  "description": "Made for high-output days.\n\nEverything you love about the Shafer, now with power for longer rides, bigger adventures, and more time with friends.\n\nPower that feels like you\n\nThe TQ HPR60 delivers 60Nm of torque and 350W of power in a drive unit that weighs just 1.9kg. Choose Eco, Mid, or High to match the ride.\n\nRange for real rides\n\nA 360Wh integrated battery gives you range for climbing on your favorite rides. Add the optional 160Wh range extender for even longer days in the saddle.\n\nProven geometry, evolved\n\nShafer HP is built upon Shafer’s award-winning platform that keeps the stable, confident feel riders love.\n\nWide open\n\nClearance for 700x58c (29x2.25\") tires with wide rims adds traction, comfort, and speed over rough terrain.",
